WEBVTT

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:18.790
Awesome!

00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:19.880
Rock...

00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:21.960
And look at the view count!

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:23.080
10,000?!

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:23.080
Views

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:25.330
There's a ton of comments, too.

00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:28.880
How are we supposed to compete with that?

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:32.330
Their live shows are impressive enough.
Publicity like this is just overkill...

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:35.080
Seems like the audience at their
next performance is gonna be huge.

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:37.750
Wouldn't be surprised if that was the whole point.

00:00:37.750 --> 00:00:40.630
The greater the number of people at their live shows...

00:00:40.830 --> 00:00:42.170
"You'll understand once you listen."

00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:48.210
RAS is in second place.

00:00:48.210 --> 00:00:50.880
Says here they're already at 4921 votes.

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:52.330
Roselia's in first!

00:00:52.670 --> 00:00:52.960
Which means their live shows alone
must be totally insane.

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:53.960
Kasumi-!
Which means their live shows alone
must be totally insane.

00:00:53.960 --> 00:00:55.630
Which means their live shows alone
must be totally insane.

00:00:55.630 --> 00:00:56.710
What about PoPiPa?

00:00:57.170 --> 00:00:57.880
Hey-!

00:00:57.880 --> 00:00:59.960
Further down on the list, I think...

00:01:01.670 --> 00:01:04.580
I mean, we've only had a chance to perform twice...

00:01:04.580 --> 00:01:06.880
What's taking so long...?

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:10.000
Mass Gap

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:10.000
Apple point!

00:01:08.710 --> 00:01:09.710
Found it.

00:01:11.330 --> 00:01:13.330
231st place...

00:01:18.750 --> 00:01:20.290
Let's make one ourselves!

00:01:21.210 --> 00:01:22.880
A Poppin' Party MV!

00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:25.750
Wha-?

00:01:25.750 --> 00:01:26.960
Seriously?

00:01:26.960 --> 00:01:29.710
Yup! Time to go the extra mile!

00:01:29.710 --> 00:01:31.420
Sure, but...

00:01:31.670 --> 00:01:33.460
A PoPiPa MV...

00:01:33.460 --> 00:01:34.710
"PoPi-V"!

00:01:34.710 --> 00:01:35.630
PoPi-V!

00:01:35.630 --> 00:01:36.880
PoPi-V...

00:01:36.880 --> 00:01:38.080
Sounds fun!

00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:41.460
Except our camera's kind of old...

00:01:41.460 --> 00:01:42.830
T-true...

00:01:42.830 --> 00:01:44.790
Think Galaxy would let us borrow one?

00:01:44.790 --> 00:01:46.420
We should ask Rock-chan!

00:01:46.420 --> 00:01:47.420
Are you serious?!

00:01:47.420 --> 00:01:48.290
Yup!

00:01:48.290 --> 00:01:51.920
C'mon! Let's make a PoPi-V!

00:01:51.920 --> 00:01:57.000
Po-Pi-Pa! Pi-Po-Pa! Po-Pi-Pa-Pa-Pi-Po-Pa!

00:01:57.460 --> 00:02:00.670
Have any of you ever made an MV before?

00:03:34.210 --> 00:03:35.960
Hey, Asahi-san!

00:03:34.960 --> 00:03:35.960
Haneoka Girls' Academy

00:03:36.130 --> 00:03:37.830
This is you, isn't it?

00:03:38.710 --> 00:03:41.130
W-well, um...

00:03:41.130 --> 00:03:42.290
She's right!

00:03:42.290 --> 00:03:43.460
There you are!

00:03:43.460 --> 00:03:44.750
I knew it!

00:03:44.750 --> 00:03:46.290
You joined RAS, didn't you?!

00:03:45.170 --> 00:03:48.540
PoPi-V!

00:03:46.290 --> 00:03:47.750
Is "LOCK" your stage name?

00:03:47.750 --> 00:03:49.210
Oh, uh...

00:03:49.210 --> 00:03:52.460
Th-that was CHU2-san's idea...

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:53.290
CHU2?

00:03:53.290 --> 00:03:54.630
The girl from the other day, right?

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:56.710
I can't get over how cute she is!

00:03:56.710 --> 00:03:58.790
We'll come cheer you on
at your next performance!

00:03:58.790 --> 00:04:00.040
Good luck!

00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:01.920
'Kay. Thanks!

00:04:06.920 --> 00:04:08.580
I got recognized...

00:04:08.580 --> 00:04:10.960
So, you're a member of RAS now.

00:04:11.750 --> 00:04:13.920
Would've been nice to know...

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:15.080
I'm sorry!

00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:17.210
Up until now, I was (temporary)...

00:04:17.210 --> 00:04:18.750
"(Temporary)"?

00:04:19.080 --> 00:04:21.500
Not an official member.

00:04:22.210 --> 00:04:23.750
After the MV...

00:04:23.750 --> 00:04:27.710
I joined for real after we
finished shooting the music video.

00:04:27.960 --> 00:04:29.580
Oh, I get it!

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:32.710
At first, I was afraid I'd be
too intimidated by everyone...

00:04:32.710 --> 00:04:35.830
But when we started playing together, I felt like...

00:04:36.330 --> 00:04:38.000
How should I put it...?

00:04:38.420 --> 00:04:41.250
Like they were the members
you'd been searching for all along?

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:42.330
Huh?

00:04:42.330 --> 00:04:43.750
Don't you remember what she said?

00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:48.130
She wants to perform alongside members
like my big sister and her friends.

00:04:48.130 --> 00:04:49.420
Oh!

00:04:50.960 --> 00:04:52.040
Yeah.

00:04:52.380 --> 00:04:54.130
Hopefully I got lucky!

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:18.750
Aren't they the cutest?!

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:20.420
Y-yeah...

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:23.210
Hurry, Chisato-chan! We're going to be late!

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:25.880
You're the one who forgot about
tidying up the classroom.

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:27.500
I'm sorry...

00:05:28.420 --> 00:05:29.420
Hey, guys!

00:05:29.420 --> 00:05:30.830
Sorry we're late!

00:05:32.380 --> 00:05:36.630
Um... Thank you for taking time
out of your busy schedule...

00:05:36.630 --> 00:05:39.750
Our lessons aren't until later.
Don't worry about it.

00:05:39.750 --> 00:05:42.250
You're making your own music video, right?

00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:43.630
How exciting!

00:05:43.630 --> 00:05:44.630
Yes!

00:05:44.830 --> 00:05:46.080
But...

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:49.080
We did some research, but we're kind of lost...

00:05:49.080 --> 00:05:51.500
We were hoping you could give us a few pointers.

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:55.830
The music video for
"Luminous Once More" was adorable.

00:05:55.830 --> 00:05:58.790
The scene in the meadow is my favorite!

00:05:58.790 --> 00:06:00.080
Much appreciated!

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:02.540
I like that scene, myself.

00:06:02.540 --> 00:06:05.380
Did you have to fly overseas to find a good location?

00:06:05.380 --> 00:06:06.500
That was Chiba.

00:06:06.500 --> 00:06:07.420
Chiba?!

00:06:07.420 --> 00:06:08.880
Whoa, no way!

00:06:09.790 --> 00:06:12.380
It was a giant cattle ranch.

00:06:12.630 --> 00:06:15.920
The cows came flocking to the stage
when Aya-chan started singing.

00:06:15.920 --> 00:06:17.170
Talk about a surprise!

00:06:17.170 --> 00:06:18.290
Chisato-chan!

00:06:18.290 --> 00:06:20.000
Oh, which reminds me...

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:22.420
Aside from the meadow scene,
the entire thing was CG.

00:06:22.420 --> 00:06:23.880
CG...

00:06:24.460 --> 00:06:26.170
Like the conveyer belt scene!

00:06:26.170 --> 00:06:28.040
I love that part!

00:06:28.040 --> 00:06:29.630
How did you film it?

00:06:29.630 --> 00:06:31.790
In front of a green screen.

00:06:32.330 --> 00:06:33.670
A green screen...!

00:06:33.670 --> 00:06:36.630
Unfortunately, Maya-chan's dress
was the same shade.

00:06:37.920 --> 00:06:39.960
Her body disappeared into the background.

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:41.710
It caused quite a stir!

00:06:41.710 --> 00:06:45.000
You've got no room to talk, Aya-chan.

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:48.710
I seem to recall you passing out
in the middle of the shoot.

00:06:50.170 --> 00:06:51.920
The scene where you're all asleep!

00:06:51.920 --> 00:06:52.960
Yup.

00:06:52.960 --> 00:06:57.710
Aya-chan was supposed to wake up, and then
we would open our eyes a few seconds later...

00:07:02.290 --> 00:07:04.420
You might say we had a few challenges.

00:07:04.420 --> 00:07:07.830
Y-you see, I stayed up late
rehearsing the night before.

00:07:08.130 --> 00:07:11.420
I mighta gotten a tiny bit sleepy...

00:07:14.540 --> 00:07:17.670
Trendy MV Techniques

00:07:14.540 --> 00:07:17.670
Using a Smartphone

00:07:14.540 --> 00:07:17.670
Mastering the Art of the MV

00:07:14.540 --> 00:07:17.670
Let's Make

00:07:14.550 --> 00:07:17.670
a Music Video

00:07:14.830 --> 00:07:17.670
These were all I could find at the library...

00:07:17.920 --> 00:07:20.210
"Let's Make a Music Video"...

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:23.540
"Mastering the Art of the MV"...

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:26.040
"Trendy MV Techniques"...

00:07:26.040 --> 00:07:27.540
Trendy!

00:07:27.540 --> 00:07:29.790
I thought they might be helpful...

00:07:29.790 --> 00:07:31.330
Thanks a bunch!

00:07:31.330 --> 00:07:34.330
How did you and the other
members of RAS make your MV?

00:07:34.330 --> 00:07:36.670
You were insanely cool, Rock.

00:07:37.460 --> 00:07:41.250
I-I'm not worthy of such praise! Not worthy at all!

00:07:41.460 --> 00:07:45.080
Any advice you can give us would be most welcome.

00:07:46.710 --> 00:07:48.460
W-well...

00:07:48.830 --> 00:07:52.380
We stood inside of these boxes
and shot at glass with our fingers...

00:07:52.380 --> 00:07:54.880
Boxes and finger guns...

00:07:54.880 --> 00:07:55.710
Oh!

00:07:55.710 --> 00:07:59.420
Apparently, you aren't supposed to focus
on one moving part.

00:07:59.420 --> 00:08:02.380
Everything has to flow in order for
an MV to be complete.

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:04.670
Same as with a band, I guess!

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:06.000
Makes sense...

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:08.080
O-of course...

00:08:09.540 --> 00:08:11.750
Here're the boxes you ordered.

00:08:11.750 --> 00:08:13.460
Great! Thanks.

00:08:13.460 --> 00:08:16.250
Better get a nice shot of Arisa's bonsai in the video!

00:08:16.250 --> 00:08:18.130
Kasumi! What do you think you're doing?

00:08:18.710 --> 00:08:20.830
Gimme that! The camera isn't even ours.

00:08:22.080 --> 00:08:23.380
I volunteer!

00:08:26.880 --> 00:08:28.880
Maybe someone else should do it...

00:08:30.540 --> 00:08:33.330
Then how about Rimi-rin and I man the camera?

00:08:33.330 --> 00:08:35.130
Arisa, you be the director.

00:08:36.500 --> 00:08:38.500
I get to do the filming?

00:08:38.500 --> 00:08:40.170
Seems to me you're the best fit for the job.

00:08:41.380 --> 00:08:43.880
We can trade off. What do you think, Arisa?

00:08:43.880 --> 00:08:45.170
Director...

00:08:45.960 --> 00:08:47.540
Director, huh...?

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:49.080
Director!

00:08:49.080 --> 00:08:51.210
Reporting for duty!

00:08:55.130 --> 00:08:57.000
Places, everyone!

00:08:57.330 --> 00:08:58.960
Lift your heads up high.

00:09:00.880 --> 00:09:02.540
Gaze off into the distance...

00:09:05.380 --> 00:09:07.540
Crouch down into the boxes...

00:09:10.210 --> 00:09:11.290
Break out!

00:09:13.750 --> 00:09:14.710
Pose, and...!

00:09:14.920 --> 00:09:16.170
Bang!

00:09:16.670 --> 00:09:18.460
And cut!

00:09:19.290 --> 00:09:20.210
Yay!

00:09:20.210 --> 00:09:21.460
We nailed it!

00:09:21.460 --> 00:09:22.540
Yay!

00:09:22.630 --> 00:09:24.250
Hanasakigawa Girls' Academy

00:09:40.790 --> 00:09:43.500
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!
Oh God, it's creeping me out!

00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:46.170
Guess we went the wrong direction...
What do you think?

00:09:46.170 --> 00:09:48.580
I'm not sure it fits the song...

00:09:48.580 --> 00:09:51.460
Arisa's acting was way too stiff...

00:09:51.460 --> 00:09:52.630
Me?!

00:09:52.630 --> 00:09:54.290
If anything, you're the stiff one!

00:09:54.290 --> 00:09:55.960
We ought to smile more.

00:09:55.960 --> 00:09:57.290
You think so...?

00:09:57.290 --> 00:09:58.170
"Smile"?!

00:09:58.500 --> 00:10:00.130
What a fantastic idea!

00:10:00.130 --> 00:10:01.130
Kokoro!

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:14.460
I had a great time today.

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:16.580
Let's put on another show together soon!

00:10:16.580 --> 00:10:17.920
Catch you later!

00:10:17.920 --> 00:10:18.920
How fleeting...

00:10:18.920 --> 00:10:20.790
Will you be alright?

00:10:20.790 --> 00:10:22.880
N-nice work out there.

00:10:23.210 --> 00:10:25.000
Later!

00:10:28.330 --> 00:10:30.000
What an exciting day!

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:33.130
Kindergarten recitals are no joke...

00:10:33.130 --> 00:10:34.920
Those kids are tough cookies!

00:10:34.920 --> 00:10:38.080
The amount of energy they
put into their singing and dancing...

00:10:38.080 --> 00:10:41.500
How in the world do they
put on those shows so often...?

00:10:41.500 --> 00:10:44.170
They must not have time to compete
in the BanG Dream...

00:10:44.170 --> 00:10:45.380
Yay!

00:10:46.250 --> 00:10:47.830
Yay!

00:10:48.580 --> 00:10:50.380
Not bad!

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:56.460
Sharing a goal and performing at the Budokan
together seemed nice at the time...

00:10:56.670 --> 00:10:58.210
Sharper movements, ladies!

00:10:58.210 --> 00:10:59.040
Yay!

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:00.170
Yay!

00:11:00.380 --> 00:11:03.130
But at this rate, it's beginning to
feel like a pipe dream.

00:11:03.130 --> 00:11:04.380
Arisa-chan...

00:11:07.170 --> 00:11:08.750
Wh-what are you filming me for?!

00:11:08.750 --> 00:11:10.040
I thought you looked pretty.

00:11:11.040 --> 00:11:14.170
O-oh, what a lovely sunset!

00:11:16.580 --> 00:11:18.420
Chocolate Coronets

00:11:18.330 --> 00:11:21.040
Wow, that's a ton of pictures.

00:11:18.420 --> 00:11:20.130
PoPiPa Concert

00:11:20.130 --> 00:11:21.420
PoPiPa Warehouse Practice

00:11:21.420 --> 00:11:22.960
Wanna look through 'em with me?

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:32.920
Sure does take me back...

00:11:34.630 --> 00:11:39.170
Originally, I was going to send
my big sister a video diary...

00:11:39.170 --> 00:11:41.580
But somewhere along the way,
I might've gone overboard.

00:11:41.580 --> 00:11:43.130
We hath returned!

00:11:43.130 --> 00:11:44.580
Whatcha lookin' at?

00:11:44.830 --> 00:11:46.460
I remember that spring.

00:11:46.790 --> 00:11:48.830
That was during the summer!

00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:51.290
I've got a picture of Arisa from the fall.

00:11:51.290 --> 00:11:52.210
What?!

00:11:52.210 --> 00:11:53.290
Same here!

00:11:53.290 --> 00:11:54.290
Seriously?!

00:11:54.290 --> 00:11:55.750
I have a confession...

00:11:55.750 --> 00:11:57.920
Y-you, too?!

00:12:00.920 --> 00:12:02.540
Since when am I a rabbit?!

00:12:02.540 --> 00:12:05.420
Oddie's gotten even bigger!

00:12:05.420 --> 00:12:07.630
Danjuro's been awfully playful lately.

00:12:07.630 --> 00:12:10.630
I wanna have another sleepover
at your house sometime, O-Tae!

00:12:10.630 --> 00:12:13.080
Don't you think we caused
enough trouble the last time?

00:12:13.630 --> 00:12:17.420
My mom said you're welcome to come back
and visit whenever you like.

00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:21.170
I just had the perfect idea!

00:12:29.750 --> 00:12:32.000
Thank you for giving me another ride home...

00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:33.580
My place ain't far.

00:12:33.580 --> 00:12:34.500
Um...

00:12:34.500 --> 00:12:37.920
Which do you prefer: Snacks or a bath?

00:12:37.920 --> 00:12:38.960
Huh?

00:12:38.960 --> 00:12:42.040
I-I'd like to repay you for your kindness!

00:12:43.540 --> 00:12:44.830
Sure you don't mind?!

00:12:55.460 --> 00:12:58.500
I've always wanted to do somethin' like this.

00:12:58.500 --> 00:12:59.880
Really?

00:13:00.630 --> 00:13:03.790
Been runnin' back an' forth to the same school
ever since kindergarten.

00:13:03.790 --> 00:13:08.040
Never got a chance to hang out
with anyone in the shoppin' district.

00:13:09.500 --> 00:13:11.290
And someday...

00:13:11.290 --> 00:13:13.880
I hope the band gets to do stuff together,

00:13:13.880 --> 00:13:17.960
like stop for ramen and a bath
on the way home from practice.

00:13:18.540 --> 00:13:19.630
Am I right?!

00:13:22.330 --> 00:13:25.580
Can you send me that photo, Arisa-chan?

00:13:26.080 --> 00:13:27.460
Are you going to use it?

00:13:27.460 --> 00:13:30.710
But I'm making such a weird face...

00:13:30.710 --> 00:13:32.960
That's not even the worst one.

00:13:32.960 --> 00:13:34.250
What?!

00:13:34.250 --> 00:13:35.670
Can we include Oddie, too?

00:13:35.670 --> 00:13:37.830
Good idea! Let's add pictures of him!

00:13:37.830 --> 00:13:40.540
I brought a video we should use, too!

00:13:41.040 --> 00:13:43.960
It's a recording of our first self-sponsored live show!

00:13:41.040 --> 00:13:43.960
Poppin' Party 1st Self-Sponsored Live Show

00:13:41.040 --> 00:13:43.960
PoPiPa PaPiPo Party

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:45.460
Yeah, no problem!

00:13:45.790 --> 00:13:46.710
And Gogh.

00:13:46.710 --> 00:13:47.540
Yup!

00:13:47.920 --> 00:13:49.830
Are we seriously including the rabbits...?

00:13:49.830 --> 00:13:52.830
Let's include everything we love most in the world!

00:13:53.580 --> 00:13:55.750
Does that mean Tenryugawa can be in it, too?!

00:13:55.750 --> 00:13:56.500
Of course!

00:13:56.500 --> 00:13:57.920
What about Chris and Cocoa?

00:13:57.920 --> 00:13:59.460
Sure, more rabbits...

00:13:59.460 --> 00:14:01.210
And chocolate coronets for Rimi-rin!

00:14:01.210 --> 00:14:02.710
Way ahead of you!

00:14:02.710 --> 00:14:03.830
Figured as much.

00:14:03.830 --> 00:14:05.920
My Random Star and Atchan!

00:14:06.540 --> 00:14:07.790
Jun and Sana, too!

00:14:07.790 --> 00:14:09.250
Hanazono Land.

00:14:09.500 --> 00:14:12.000
This is startin' to get outta control...

00:14:12.000 --> 00:14:16.330
But the more of our favorite stuff we include,
the more special it feels!

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:18.750
Then why not have our friends join in on the fun?!

00:14:21.420 --> 00:14:23.920
Eve! Hagumi!

00:14:24.080 --> 00:14:25.290
What's up?

00:14:26.080 --> 00:14:28.710
We thank you in advance for your cooperation.

00:14:28.710 --> 00:14:30.750
Can you spare a moment of your time?

00:14:30.750 --> 00:14:32.130
Please!

00:14:32.130 --> 00:14:33.460
Sounds like fun!

00:14:33.460 --> 00:14:34.330
Huh?

00:14:34.330 --> 00:14:36.460
No problem. What about you, Yukina?

00:14:36.460 --> 00:14:37.460
Huh?

00:14:38.080 --> 00:14:39.290
Thanks, guys.

00:14:39.290 --> 00:14:40.710
Let us know when it's done, 'kay?

00:14:40.710 --> 00:14:41.380
Of course!

00:14:41.380 --> 00:14:42.330
Laters!

00:14:42.330 --> 00:14:44.170
Bye-bye!

00:14:50.500 --> 00:14:53.420
This footage is going to be a huge help...

00:14:54.130 --> 00:14:55.790
We can't let everyone down!

00:14:55.790 --> 00:14:57.130
I'll help however I can!

00:14:57.130 --> 00:14:57.710
O-

00:14:57.710 --> 00:14:59.000
Alright already!

00:14:59.420 --> 00:15:01.460
Leave the editing to me and Rimi.

00:15:01.460 --> 00:15:03.130
The rest of you are dismissed!

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:04.130
Good luck, you guys.

00:15:04.130 --> 00:15:04.960
Thanks!

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:06.210
You can count on us!

00:15:48.540 --> 00:15:49.960
Mission complete.

00:15:50.420 --> 00:15:51.960
Yay!

00:15:52.290 --> 00:15:55.080
I brought you a chocolate coronet
for your troubles, Rimi-rin!

00:15:55.080 --> 00:15:57.790
Thanks, Saaya-chan!

00:16:00.920 --> 00:16:03.290
Crap, my heart won't quit pounding.

00:16:03.290 --> 00:16:05.290
Let's count it down together!

00:16:05.290 --> 00:16:06.040
Five!

00:16:06.040 --> 00:16:07.040
Right now-?!

00:16:07.040 --> 00:16:07.750
Four!

00:16:07.750 --> 00:16:09.170
Th-three!

00:16:09.170 --> 00:16:10.000
Two!

00:16:10.000 --> 00:16:10.960
One!

00:18:24.960 --> 00:18:27.580
Wh-what do you think?

00:18:27.580 --> 00:18:29.130
That was awesome!

00:18:29.130 --> 00:18:31.460
Incredible! Just like a real MV!

00:18:31.460 --> 00:18:33.170
And full of the things we love!

00:18:33.170 --> 00:18:35.290
Including everything was the right choice, after all.

00:18:35.290 --> 00:18:37.330
The two of you are amazing!

00:18:37.330 --> 00:18:39.380
Good ol' Rimi-rin!

00:18:39.380 --> 00:18:41.880
We couldn't have done it
without everyone's help...

00:18:41.880 --> 00:18:43.290
You guys saved us!

00:18:44.540 --> 00:18:46.500
Bow down before my might!

00:18:46.500 --> 00:18:48.290
All hail the queen!

00:18:48.460 --> 00:18:51.330
Shall we go ahead and upload it to the website?

00:18:52.130 --> 00:18:53.500
Already?!

00:18:53.500 --> 00:18:55.210
Gimme a second to brace myself!

00:18:59.500 --> 00:19:00.830
Okay, it's time!

00:19:00.830 --> 00:19:01.960
Kasumi-!

00:19:02.080 --> 00:19:06.380
UPLOAD

00:19:02.080 --> 00:19:06.380
Uploading video...

00:19:06.380 --> 00:19:06.580
UPLOAD

00:19:06.580 --> 00:19:09.630
UPLOAD

00:19:06.580 --> 00:19:09.630
Click below to submit video

00:19:06.590 --> 00:19:09.630
SUBMIT

00:19:13.380 --> 00:19:15.790
Hey, how 'bout we do it together?

00:19:22.130 --> 00:19:24.290
You're shaking, Arisa!

00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:26.540
Don't be so nervous.

00:19:26.540 --> 00:19:28.130
Relax!

00:19:28.130 --> 00:19:29.460
Shut up!

00:19:29.460 --> 00:19:31.040
Here we go, Rimi!

00:19:31.040 --> 00:19:31.880
'Kay!

00:19:32.210 --> 00:19:33.750
Ready, set...!

00:19:33.920 --> 00:19:34.790
UPLOAD

00:19:33.920 --> 00:19:34.790
Click below to submit video

00:19:33.920 --> 00:19:34.790
SUBMIT

00:19:34.790 --> 00:19:35.420
UPLOAD

00:19:34.790 --> 00:19:35.420
SUBMIT

00:19:35.420 --> 00:19:36.880
UPLOAD

00:19:35.420 --> 00:19:36.880
Upload complete

00:19:35.420 --> 00:19:36.880
SUBMIT

00:19:37.920 --> 00:19:39.710
Oh crap, we did it!

00:19:40.040 --> 00:19:41.960
The entire world can see our video.

00:19:41.960 --> 00:19:44.920
Makes me feel a little uneasy...

00:19:44.920 --> 00:19:48.170
What if nobody ends up watching it?

00:19:48.540 --> 00:19:50.880
I'll watch it all night long, myself!

00:19:56.960 --> 00:19:59.670
Expected nothin' less!

00:20:00.080 --> 00:20:01.750
How cool...

00:20:10.540 --> 00:20:12.250
Yup, there we are.

00:20:12.500 --> 00:20:14.210
Not too shabby!

00:20:15.790 --> 00:20:17.920
What did you do that for?

00:20:17.920 --> 00:20:20.540
Clicking the star adds a like to the video.

00:20:20.960 --> 00:20:22.210
A "like"...

00:20:24.170 --> 00:20:26.540
You did it, Rimi-rin!

00:20:26.540 --> 00:20:28.250
Thank goodness!

00:20:28.250 --> 00:20:29.500
They liked it...

00:20:30.290 --> 00:20:32.460
Five whole people liked it!

00:20:33.210 --> 00:20:34.630
Rimi-!

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:41.670
Is she asleep?!

00:20:41.670 --> 00:20:43.420
Can you blame her?

00:20:43.420 --> 00:20:47.380
Go to sleep! Go to sleep!

00:20:47.380 --> 00:20:48.500
Go to sleep, little Arisa!

00:20:48.500 --> 00:20:49.830
Knock it off!
Go to sleep, little Arisa!

00:20:49.830 --> 00:20:50.830
Go to sleep, little Arisa!

00:20:50.830 --> 00:20:51.290
Seriously?!
Go to sleep, little Arisa!

00:20:51.290 --> 00:20:51.830
Seriously?!

00:20:51.830 --> 00:20:56.710
For cryin' out loud... Shut up already!

00:21:02.330 --> 00:21:04.290
We'll be waiting outside.

00:21:10.630 --> 00:21:13.130
I assume you've seen our MV by now.

00:21:13.540 --> 00:21:18.330
Roselia could never make an MV of such caliber,
but you're welcome to create an inferior copy.

00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:20.830
Sorry, haven't seen it.

00:21:20.830 --> 00:21:22.830
Besides, Roselia doesn't need an MV.

00:21:23.210 --> 00:21:25.790
We are competing based on our live performances.

00:21:25.790 --> 00:21:27.500
"Competing," you say?

00:21:27.500 --> 00:21:29.210
Then let's compete!

00:21:29.210 --> 00:21:31.540
Put on a show at the same venue as RAS.

00:21:32.710 --> 00:21:35.080
These other bands aren't worth our time.

00:21:35.080 --> 00:21:37.330
We'll go head-to-head.

00:21:37.330 --> 00:21:42.250
I propose a battle in front of everyone to prove
which of our bands is the champion of this era!

00:21:44.130 --> 00:21:46.460
Do you accept? Or...

00:21:46.460 --> 00:21:47.460
I accept.

00:23:34.880 --> 00:23:37.630
Next Time: This is it.
